<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gemex raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gemex raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Wednesday analysts Scott Wilkins and Marco Vera had upgraded their rating for Grupo Embotellador de Mexico SA de CV, or Gemex, to buy from sell.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts were down 3/8 to 9-3/4 in New York trade.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
